statute_section : 

rule_id         : draftly-rule-commonlii-LKCA-1905-33-3
statement       : A party can re-apportion shares by allotting purchased interests to another party.
statute_section : 

rule_id         : draftly-rule-commonlii-LKCA-1907-2-1
